#: ../../src/dll.rst:5
msgid "Shared library handling"
msgstr "共享库处理"

#: ../../src/dll.rst:7
msgid ""
"libuv provides cross platform utilities for loading shared libraries and "
"retrieving symbols from them, using the following API."
msgstr "libuv 通过以下 API 提供跨平台的实用工具，用于加载共享库并从中检索符号。"

#: ../../src/dll.rst:12
msgid "Data types"
msgstr "数据类型"

#: ../../src/dll.rst:16
msgid "Shared library data type."
msgstr "共享库数据类型。"

#: ../../src/dll.rst:20
msgid "Public members"
msgstr "公开成员"

#: ../../src/dll.rst:22
msgid "N/A"
msgstr "无"

#: ../../src/dll.rst:26
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: ../../src/dll.rst:30
msgid ""
"Opens a shared library. The filename is in utf-8. Returns 0 on success "
"and -1 on error. Call :c:func:`uv_dlerror` to get the error message."
msgstr "打开共享库。文件名采用 utf-8 编码。成功时返回 0，出错时返回 -1。调用 :c:func:`uv_dlerror` 获取错误信息。"

#: ../../src/dll.rst:35
msgid "Close the shared library."
msgstr "关闭共享库。"

#: ../../src/dll.rst:39
msgid ""
"Retrieves a data pointer from a dynamic library. It is legal for a symbol"
" to map to NULL. Returns 0 on success and -1 if the symbol was not found."
msgstr "从动态库中检索数据指针。符号映射为 NULL 是合法的。成功时返回 0，若未找到符号则返回 -1。"

#: ../../src/dll.rst:44
msgid "Returns the last uv_dlopen() or uv_dlsym() error message."
msgstr "返回上一次 uv_dlopen() 或 uv_dlsym() 的错误信息。"

